[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "最優秀賞の特典がまさか１か月の食堂無料券とはねー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who would've thought the grand prize would be a month of free cafeteria tickets!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、気が済むまで食ってやる……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, I'm gonna eat to my heart's content...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あまり食べすぎちゃダメですよ。\n午後も授業あるんですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't overdo it. We still have afternoon classes, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かってるってー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, yeah, I know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "相席いいか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mind if I join you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ユナさん！\u3000どうぞどうぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Juna! Please, have a seat!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……その様子だと、仲も戻ったようだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It seems you two have patched things up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あー……気遣わせてごめんね。\n見ての通り、私たち仲良し二人組！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... sorry for making you worry. As you can see, we're the best of friends again!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうか。何よりだな。\n最優秀賞、改めておめでとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad to hear it. And congratulations again on winning first place."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがと。ユナさんも、実行委員お疲れさま",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks. And thank you for all your hard work on the committee, Juna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ずっと忙しそうでしたもんね。\n無事に終わってよかったです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You looked so busy the entire time. I'm glad everything went smoothly in the end."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。だが……私にとってはこれからが本番だ。\nまだ気は抜けない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. However... for me, the real challenge begins now. I can't afford to let my guard down yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じきに生徒会選挙が始まる。\n文化祭はその期の生徒会最後の行事だからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The student council election will begin soon. The cultural festival is the current council's final event."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナさんも立候補されるんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you running for a position, Juna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。私は生徒会長を目指す",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I'm aiming to become the student council president."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナさんならきっとなれるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You'll definitely make it, Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "応援してます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're rooting for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふーむ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実行委員としての彼女の働き。\nそれ自体は及第点ではあった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Her work as committee chair was passable, I suppose..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただ、彼女ではやはり力不足かもね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But she still lacks what it takes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私が直々に動くとするか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Perhaps it's time I made my move."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]